{
  "_comment": [
    "Pinned inventory of the local MCP connector servers this host registers.",
    "Audited third-party servers are NOT vendored into this repo (different",
    "languages, upstream update path, see docs/google-source.md); they are cloned",
    "at the exact audited commit instead. This file is the machine-readable pin —",
    "docs/*.md keep the audit findings and security posture prose.",
    "",
    "Credentials are never described here beyond their expected path and mode.",
    "OAuth consent is owner-only and is never automated by setup-connectors.mjs.",
    "",
    "Every connector is readOnly except gcal-write, which can create calendar",
    "events and nothing else. Adding another readOnly:false entry, or widening",
    "an existing one, needs an audit note in docs/ and owner sign-off.",
    "",
    "Not listed: plaid (docs/plaid-financial-source.md) — audited on a previous",
    "machine, never installed on this mini and not registered. Add an entry here",
    "when it is stood up, with a pinned commit."
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "connectors": [
    {
      "slug": "gmail",
      "connectorSlug": "google",
      "mcpServerName": "gmail",
      "readOnly": true,
      "docs": "docs/google-source.md",
      "source": {
        "kind": "git",
        "repo": "https://github.com/Maheidem/gmail-mcp.git",
        "commit": "e054cf1efe82e386552bf8e1e6d0115f5ac86c3e",
        "installPath": "~/src/gmail-mcp-audit"
      },
      "build": {
        "runtime": "python",
        "steps": ["python3 -m venv .venv", "./.venv/bin/pip install -e ."],
        "artifact": ".venv/bin/python"
      },
      "register": {
        "command": "{{installDir}}/.venv/bin/python",
        "args": ["-m", "gmail_mcp"]
      },
      "credentialFiles": [
        { "path": "~/.gmail-mcp/gcp-oauth.keys.json", "mode": "600" },
        { "path": "~/.gmail-mcp/token.json", "mode": "600" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "slug": "gcal",
      "connectorSlug": "google",
      "mcpServerName": "gcal",
      "readOnly": true,
      "docs": "docs/google-source.md",
      "source": {
        "kind": "git",
        "repo": "https://github.com/geraldcroes/gcal-readonly-mcp.git",
        "commit": "b75c062b51f10aebd5f865c15789bec1515478b2",
        "installPath": "~/src/gcal-readonly-mcp-audit"
      },
      "build": {
        "runtime": "go",
        "steps": ["go build -o gcal-readonly-mcp ."],
        "artifact": "gcal-readonly-mcp"
      },
      "register": {
        "command": "{{installDir}}/gcal-readonly-mcp",
        "args": []
      },
      "credentialFiles": [
        { "path": "~/.config/gcal-readonly-mcp/credentials.json", "mode": "600" },
        { "path": "~/.config/gcal-readonly-mcp/config.json", "mode": "600" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "slug": "gcal-write",
      "connectorSlug": "google_write",
      "mcpServerName": "gcal-write",
      "readOnly": false,
      "docs": "docs/google-source.md",
      "source": {
        "kind": "workspace",
        "installPath": "apps/gcal-write-mcp"
      },
      "build": {
        "runtime": "node",
        "steps": ["pnpm --filter @skippy/gcal-write-mcp build"],
        "artifact": "dist/stdio.js"
      },
      "register": {
        "command": "node",
        "args": ["{{installDir}}/dist/stdio.js"]
      },
      "credentialFiles": [
        { "path": "~/.config/gcal-write-mcp/credentials.json", "mode": "600" },
        { "path": "~/.config/gcal-write-mcp/token.json", "mode": "600" }
      ],
      "hostRequirements": [
        "Owner-only one-time consent: node apps/gcal-write-mcp/dist/stdio.js --authorize (scope: calendar.events)",
        "Advertised as connector \"google_write\", separate from read-only \"google\" — a host offering reads must not implicitly grant writes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "slug": "imessage",
      "connectorSlug": "imessage",
      "mcpServerName": "imessage",
      "readOnly": true,
      "docs": "docs/imessage-source.md",
      "source": {
        "kind": "workspace",
        "installPath": "apps/imessage-mcp"
      },
      "build": {
        "runtime": "node",
        "steps": ["pnpm --filter @skippy/imessage-mcp build"],
        "artifact": "dist/stdio.js"
      },
      "register": {
        "command": "node",
        "args": ["{{installDir}}/dist/stdio.js"]
      },
      "credentialFiles": [],
      "hostRequirements": [
        "Full Disk Access granted to the node binary that launches this server (readonly ~/Library/Messages/chat.db)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
